Acceptance criteria:
New opt-in view leaves Claire default and every previous mode unchanged.
Robot uses original independently authored rigid armor geometry, no human skin
or hairstyle, downloads, copied artwork, logos, imported assets or dependencies.
Jaw/lip/brow plates respond to generated motion, not audio volume or a timer.
Pause/seek/restart/mode switches retain the same speech and clock; neutral resets.
Both cursor modes, manual XYZ, zoom and transparent overlay work with robot fit.
Human-only controls are unavailable in robot mode and restored on return.
Geometry/resources are selected-only and bounded; no per-frame mesh rebuilding,
normal recomputation or new buffers. Leaving the view deletes its GPU resources.
Errors remain visible; context loss pauses audio and requires reload.
Synthetic/unit and isolated in-memory native checks do not capture screenshots.
Existing FaceMesh optics remain red; robot optics are cyan as proposed/selected.
No README redesign, new media, release, parked Realistic resumption or user-app restart.
Visual likeness, realistic expressions and human/phonetic acceptance are not implied.

